  "id": "grief-work",
  "term": "grief work",
  "definition": "Grief work is the process of coming to terms with loss, sadness, and the tragic side of painful events. In this context, it emphasizes compassionate, shared ways of processing suffering and death rather than focusing only on fear or threat.",
